Feb 25th Drum & Dance Day - Learn The Basics!

Rhythm Culture Presents Drum & Dance FUN-DA-MENTALS

Always wanted to drum or dance but never thought you could? Always told you have no sense of rhythm and two left feet? Maybe you were just never taught the FUN-da-mentals.

Rhythm Culture presents DRUM & DANCE FUN-da-mentals series. These drum and dance sessions are for those with no drumming or musical experience, but liked the look of dancing or loved the sound of drumming and wanted to give it a go.

We will start at the very beginning and give you the FUN-da-mentals you need to have the confidence to drum and dance, give it a go, and not give up!!

You can book your tix [here](/product/casual-drum-dance-classes/).

Feb 25th  
12.30pm Drumming Foundations  
3.30pm African Dance 4/4 Foundations  
(1 hour classes)

$25 per class  
